          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“After you have occupied the land that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God is giving you and have settled there, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.23.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ex 23.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "each of you must place in a basket the first part of each crop that you harvest and you must take it with you to the one place of worship. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go to the priest in charge at that time and say to him, ‘I now acknowledge to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " my God that I have entered the land that he promised our ancestors to give us.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“The priest will take the basket from you and place it before the altar of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then, in the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s presence you will recite these words: ‘My ancestor was a wandering Aramean, who took his family to Egypt to live. They were few in number when they went there, but they became a large and powerful nation. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Egyptians treated us harshly and forced us to work as slaves. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then we cried out for help to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of our ancestors. He heard us and saw our suffering, hardship, and misery. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "By his great power and strength he rescued us from Egypt. He worked miracles and wonders, and caused terrifying things to happen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He brought us here and gave us this rich and fertile land. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So now I bring to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " the first part of the harvest that he has given me.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Then set the basket down in the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s presence and worship there. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be grateful for the good things that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God has given you and your family; and let the Levites and the foreigners who live among you join in the celebration.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
