        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.14.28+DEU.14.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Deut 14.28–29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Every third year give the tithe — a tenth of your crops — to the Levites, the foreigners, the orphans, and the widows, so that in every community they will have all they need to eat. When you have done this, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "say to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", ‘None of the sacred tithe is left in my house; I have given it to the Levites, the foreigners, the orphans, and the widows, as you commanded me to do. I have not disobeyed or forgotten any of your commands concerning the tithe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have not eaten any of it when I was mourning; I have not taken any of it out of my house when I was ritually unclean; and I have not given any of it as an offering for the dead.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26.14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "for the dead",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "to the dead.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " I have obeyed you, O ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; I have done everything you commanded concerning the tithe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Look down from your holy place in heaven and bless your people Israel; bless also the rich and fertile land that you have given us, as you promised our ancestors.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
